{"availability":"available","full":"HelgeSverre/ollama-gui","name":"ollama-gui","description":"A Web Interface for chatting with your local LLMs via the ollama API","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1259,"forks":175,"created":"2023-10-08T10:59:03Z","updated":"2026-10-13T17:54:29Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ollama-gui.vercel.app/","topics":["ai","chat-ui","gui","llm","local-llm","ollama","privacy","self-hosted","typescript","vue"],"demo":"https://ollama-gui.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T16:54:56.219Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T16:54:56.219Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T16:54:56.219Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:35:07.956Z","stars":1257,"forks":162},{"at":"2026-10-11T19:49:14.952Z","stars":1258,"forks":162},{"at":"2026-10-12T09:47:39.100Z","stars":1258,"forks":162},{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:04.622Z","stars":1258,"forks":166},{"at":"2026-10-18T16:54:56.219Z","stars":1259,"forks":175}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A web interface for chatting with local models through Ollama.","Ollama GUI is a single-page app that talks directly to the Ollama API from your browser. There is no backend of its own: chats are stored in the browser's IndexedDB and never leave your machine except to reach the Ollama server you point it at."],"features":["Chat: streaming replies that you can stop, regenerate or edit. Edits and regenerations are kept as versions you can switch between, and any reply can be branched into a new chat.","Thinking models such as qwen3, deepseek-r1 and gpt-oss: the reasoning is shown in a collapsible block, and you can turn thinking on or off (or set the effort level for gpt-oss).","Attachments: images for vision models (llava, gemma3), and text or code files, which are added to the message.","Models: search the Ollama library as you type and pick a size, then pull with progress. Also delete, inspect capabilities and context length, and unload models from memory.","Settings: system prompt and generation parameters (temperature, numctx, topp, seed and others), set globally, per model or per chat."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"588a6f5e6da84b2f65ec81c90ecc30619558e977f3ff8a6d8b79d696f024eb6e","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T09:47:39.419Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:04.699Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A web interface for chatting with local models through Ollama.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"588a6f5e6da84b2f65ec81c90ecc30619558e977f3ff8a6d8b79d696f024eb6e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:04.699Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-13T17:54:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T05:08:57.489Z","hash":"588a6f5e6da84b2f65ec81c90ecc30619558e977f3ff8a6d8b79d696f024eb6e","originalBytes":7738,"storedBytes":7738,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:04.703Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:33.431Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v2.0.1","tag":"v2.0.1","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T06:27:56Z","url":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/releases/tag/v2.0.1"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:33.431Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/de3cb2dc4b87e6a6868ac643.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-16T03:12:41.077Z","url":"https://ollama-gui.vercel.app/"}],"subjects":["Chatbots & assistants","Self-hosted apps"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Chatbots & assistants","Self-hosted apps"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Chatbots & assistants","source":"metadata","match":"chat ui"},{"subject":"Self-hosted apps","source":"metadata","matc